message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "launch-relay"
abstract: "A coin bonds on pump.fun. Seconds later a paired token for it exists on PAIR.fund, deployed from a rotating wallet, priced against the Robinhood Stock Token that actually fits the coin, with a launch plan that a human approved from their phone. None of that is hardcoded: sources, launchpads, chains, rotation, filtering, naming, and pairing"
